# Scenario 'browser_ulc': control of 'browser_ul': closed.html holds the same list WITH its </ul>; the page ends normally (Html_Layout_ClearAllFloats runs a few times and never retries)
# and the browser waits for a button.
# Navigation as in 'browser_r2' (title -> top menu -> ホームページ -> tutorial and prompts -> index of the 'ul' site, traces/web/ul, web=ul); the links of the index are, in order,
# closed, unclosed, brl_list, bra_list, brl_out, brl_after, brr_list (DOWN x N selects link N; the selection starts from none after a B).
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # title -> top menu (the first A is swallowed by the logo)
waitstable 60 max 600
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap A                        # ホームページ
waitstable 60 max 900
shot pagelist_tutorial_1
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
shot prompt
tap A                        # ホームページ
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A                        # password screen
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 1200
shot index
shot ul_index
tap B
wait 200
shot no_previous_page
tap A
wait 200
tap DOWN x1
wait 80
wait 20
tap A                        # closed.html
wait 600
shot closed_600
wait 3000
shot closed_3600
end
